IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `au-part9-more`

-- Tests for s 40A(4). Expected values are written from the text: (a) old corporations legislation, as for Part 10.1 of the
-- Corporations Act 2001; (b) old ASIC legislation, as for Part 16 of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001.

§ `Section 40A(4)`

#ASSERT `the Part that decides whether a provision of the old legislation corresponds to one of the new` `the old corporations legislation` EQUALS "Part 10.1 of the Corporations Act 2001"
#ASSERT `the Part that decides whether a provision of the old legislation corresponds to one of the new` `the old ASIC legislation` EQUALS "Part 16 of the Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001"
-- The question is decided in the same way as that Part decides it: where it treats them as corresponding, they do.
#ASSERT `the old provision corresponds to the new provision for section 40A` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the old provision corresponds to the new provision for section 40A` FALSE)
